 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Expenses (POL-EXP-01): Submit expenses in the HR portal within 30 days, with a receipt for anything over $25. Meals while travelling are covered up to $75 per day. Your manager approves expenses; a single expense over $1,000 also needs your department head. Alcohol is not reimbursed unless it is part of an approved client event.",
